---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Who's Starting Today: NHL Starting Goalies Tonight, Injuries and Lineups"
summary: "Tonight's NHL starting goalies, NBA injury status and Premier League lineups, each marked expected or confirmed with a linked source. Updated daily."
kind: home
permalink: /
---
<header class="masthead">
  <h1>Who's starting today</h1>
  <p class="tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  <p class="brand-line">{{ site.brandLine }}</p>
</header>
<section aria-labelledby="tonight-heading" class="tonight">
  <h2 id="tonight-heading">NHL starting goalies tonight</h2>
  {% set night = nhlTonight %}
  {% include "partials/goalie-board.njk" %}
  <p><a href="{{ '/nhl/starting-goalies/' | url }}">Full NHL starting goalies page and archive</a></p>
</section>
<div class="home-grid">
  <section aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
    <h2 id="latest-heading" class="section-heading">Latest</h2>
    {% set stories = collections.posts | limit(20) %}
    {% set storyHeading = "h3" %}
    {% set emptyNote = "No story yet." %}
    {% include "partials/story-list.njk" %}
    {% if collections.posts.length > 20 %}
    <p><a href="{{ '/archive/' | url }}">All stories</a></p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  <aside class="home-rail">
    <section aria-labelledby="desks-heading">
    <h2 id="desks-heading">In season now</h2>
    <div class="desk-list">
      {% for item in site.categories | selectattr("inSeason") %}
      <a class="desk-card" href="{{ item.path | url }}">
        <strong>{{ item.name }}</strong>
        <span>{{ item.description }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <h2>Coming up</h2>
    <div class="desk-list">
      {% for item in site.categories | rejectattr("inSeason") %}
      <a class="desk-card" href="{{ item.path | url }}"><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong><span>Returns {{ item.season }}.</span></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="publishing-heading">
    <h2 id="publishing-heading">How we label starters</h2>
    <ol class="process">
      <li><strong>Confirmed:</strong> the team, league or an on-site beat reporter says he starts.</li>
      <li><strong>Expected:</strong> a credible projection, such as a morning-skate report, not yet official.</li>
      <li>Every status links its source. We never guess.</li>
    </ol>
    </section>
  </aside>
</div>
